# Everything under Assets/_Project that SetupProject regenerates: every run reshuffles fileIDs, so
# a text diff is tens of thousands of lines of churn. Shown as "Bin" in git diff (git diff --text
# still reads one if it is really needed). Content and line endings are untouched.
Assets/_Project/**/*.prefab -diff linguist-generated
Assets/_Project/**/*.unity -diff linguist-generated
Assets/_Project/**/*.mat -diff linguist-generated
Assets/_Project/**/*.asset -diff linguist-generated
Assets/_Project/**/*.renderTexture -diff linguist-generated

# Binary files
*.fbx binary
*.png binary
*.ttf binary
*.xlsx binary
